WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:05.220
what does discipline really mean you
know besides waking up early and how do

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:11.969
I employ it to all aspects of my life
what does it really mean yes

00:00:11.969 --> 00:00:21.480
discipline it it does start with waking
up early it really does but that is just

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:28.529
the beginning and I always say that
discipline is the loop of all good

00:00:28.529 --> 00:00:37.440
qualities but you have to absolutely
apply it to things outside of just

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:42.239
waking up early it's it's everything
it's working now every day making

00:00:42.239 --> 00:00:49.170
yourself stronger and faster and more
flexible and healthier discipline is

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:59.520
eating the right foods to fuel your
system it it's about disciplining your

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:05.430
emotions so you can make good decisions
it's about having the discipline to

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:15.830
control your ego so your ego doesn't get
out of hand and control you it's about

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:22.920
treating people the way you would want
to be treated and doing the tasks that

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:28.860
you don't necessarily want to do but
that you know will help you or help your

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:40.350
team it's about facing your fears takes
discipline to face your fears so you can

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:49.229
conquer them and that's what discipline
is discipline means taking the hard road

00:01:49.229 --> 00:01:59.000
the uphill road to do what's right for
yourself and for other people

00:02:00.719 --> 00:02:09.479
it's so often the easy path the easy
path that calls to us to be weak for

00:02:09.479 --> 00:02:16.830
that moment to break down for that
moment to give in to the desire and the

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:25.379
short-term gratification but the
discipline will not allow that the

00:02:25.379 --> 00:02:33.360
discipline calls for strength and
fortitude and will it won't accept

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:45.930
weakness it won't tolerate another
breakdown the discipline can seem like

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:52.910
it's your worst enemy but the reality is

00:02:53.359 --> 00:02:58.489
discipline is your best friend it will
take care of you like nothing else can

00:02:58.489 --> 00:03:07.280
and it will put you on that path the
path to strength and health and

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:20.450
intelligence and happiness and most
importantly it'll put you on that path

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:23.599
to freedom

